   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it works: count every label S imposes, compare with S’s MSD",
   "originalText": "How it works: count every label S imposes, compare with S’s MSD",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 139,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Which MSD?",
   "originalText": "1. Which MSD?",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 586,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "msdOf(S) = S’s own msd, else the network’s msd, else no limit",
   "originalText": "msdOf(S) = S’s own msd, else the network’s msd, else no limit",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 230,
   "width": 870,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "RFC 8491 also has a per-link MSD; LFA Lab models only the node value. Range 2 to 255 (one octet).",
   "originalText": "RFC 8491 also has a per-link MSD; LFA Lab models only the node value. Range 2 to 255 (one octet).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 260,
   "width": 277,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. How deep is the repair?",
   "originalText": "2. How deep is the repair?",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 294,
   "width": 962,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Labels imposed = labels swapped + labels pushed (RFC 8491 §1.1). S swaps D’s own label and pushes the\nrepair list, so the whole stack of A5 counts:",
   "originalText": "Labels imposed = labels swapped + labels pushed (RFC 8491 §1.1). S swaps D’s own label and pushes the\nrepair list, so the whole stack of A5 counts:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 347,
   "width": 423,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "depth = labelStack.length = extra labels + 1\ntoo deep  ⇔  depth > msd",
   "originalText": "depth = labelStack.length = extra labels + 1\ntoo deep  ⇔  depth > msd",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 397,
   "width": 528,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#e03131",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 134623,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780393,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "S → E:  [16004, 24005, 16002]\n        3 labels (1 swapped + 2 pushed) > MSD 2 of S  ✗",
   "originalText": "S → E:  [16004, 24005, 16002]\n        3 labels (1 swapped + 2 pushed) > MSD 2 of S  ✗",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-18",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 447,
   "width": 277,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 142542,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1885122,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3. What \"too deep\" changes",
   "originalText": "3. What \"too deep\" changes",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-19",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 481,
   "width": 981,
   "height": 85,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 150461,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1989851,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The repair is still worked out and shown, marked tooDeep, but S can’t install it.\n•  It isn’t counted as TI-LFA; it is counted apart as tooDeep (tilfa + tooDeep = TI-LFA with no limit).\n•  \"Protected by\" skips it, and so do the heat map (A13) and what-if (A14).\n•  Simulation, TI-LFA mode: no backup, traffic dropped with reason too-deep.",
   "originalText": "•  The repair is still worked out and shown, marked tooDeep, but S can’t install it.\n•  It isn’t counted as TI-LFA; it is counted apart as tooDeep (tilfa + tooDeep = TI-LFA with no limit).\n•  \"Protected by\" skips it, and so do the heat map (A13) and what-if (A14).\n•  Simulation, TI-LFA mode: no backup, traffic dropped with reason too-deep.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-20",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 576,
   "width": 681,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 158380,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2094580,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "No limit (the default) changes nothing: every earlier result stays the same.",
   "originalText": "No limit (the default) changes nothing: every earlier result stays the same.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
