   "text": "Example 3, msd: 2: the 6 too-deep repairs",
   "originalText": "Example 3, msd: 2: the 6 too-deep repairs",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 820,
   "width": 396,
   "height": 150,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 459302,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6074282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PLR  D  Link  Label stack              Depth\n---  -  ----  -----------------------  -----\nS    A  A–S   16005  24006  16003      3 > 2\nS    B  A–S   16005  24006  16004      3 > 2\nS    C  S–E   16004  24005  16005      3 > 2\nS    E  S–E   16004  24005  16002      3 > 2\nA    B  B–A   16005  24006  16004      3 > 2\nE    C  E–C   16004  24005  16005      3 > 2",
   "originalText": "PLR  D  Link  Label stack              Depth\n---  -  ----  -----------------------  -----\nS    A  A–S   16005  24006  16003      3 > 2\nS    B  A–S   16005  24006  16004      3 > 2\nS    C  S–E   16004  24005  16005      3 > 2\nS    E  S–E   16004  24005  16002      3 > 2\nA    B  B–A   16005  24006  16004      3 > 2\nE    C  E–C   16004  24005  16005      3 > 2",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-59",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 980,
   "width": 819,
   "height": 57,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 467221,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6179011,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "msd 2:            TI-LFA 14/20, too deep 6 (S 4, A 1, E 1)   LFA, Remote LFA 8/20 unchanged\nmsd 3:            TI-LFA 20/20, nothing too deep\nmsd 3, S msd 2:   TI-LFA 16/20, too deep 4 (all S’s)",
   "originalText": "msd 2:            TI-LFA 14/20, too deep 6 (S 4, A 1, E 1)   LFA, Remote LFA 8/20 unchanged\nmsd 3:            TI-LFA 20/20, nothing too deep\nmsd 3, S msd 2:   TI-LFA 16/20, too deep 4 (all S’s)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-60",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1047,
   "width": 870,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 475140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6283740,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Simulation, S–E down, TI-LFA mode: traffic from S to C and to E is dropped at S, reason too-deep.",
   "originalText": "Simulation, S–E down, TI-LFA mode: traffic from S to C and to E is dropped at S, reason too-deep.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
