   "text": "Edge cases",
   "originalText": "Edge cases",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-63",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 820,
   "width": 477,
   "height": 192,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 498897,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6597927,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  LFA and Remote LFA always fit: at most 2 labels\n   (PQ label + D’s label). That is why MSD 1 isn’t\n   modelled.\n•  No shorter list is tried. The greedy walk (B15)\n   already takes the furthest Prefix-SID at each\n   step; LFA Lab always repairs along the\n   post-convergence path (B14).\n•  SRv6 (A25): the same repair is 2 SIDs and fits\n   MSD 2.",
   "originalText": "•  LFA and Remote LFA always fit: at most 2 labels\n   (PQ label + D’s label). That is why MSD 1 isn’t\n   modelled.\n•  No shorter list is tried. The greedy walk (B15)\n   already takes the furthest Prefix-SID at each\n   step; LFA Lab always repairs along the\n   post-convergence path (B14).\n•  SRv6 (A25): the same repair is 2 SIDs and fits\n   MSD 2.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
