   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Takeaway",
   "originalText": "Takeaway",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-66",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1161,
   "width": 1552,
   "height": 43,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 522654,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6912114,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A TI-LFA repair only counts if the router can push it. If the label stack is longer than the router’s MSD, the repair is shown but marked \"too deep\" and counted as\nunprotected. In Example 3 with MSD 2, 6 of 20 pairs need 3 labels, so TI-LFA coverage drops from 100% to 70%.",
   "originalText": "A TI-LFA repair only counts if the router can push it. If the label stack is longer than the router’s MSD, the repair is shown but marked \"too deep\" and counted as\nunprotected. In Example 3 with MSD 2, 6 of 20 pairs need 3 labels, so TI-LFA coverage drops from 100% to 70%.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a15-text-67",
